<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Nobody can do it like a steam!</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Who would have thought that Catra would find her place in life at the footplate of a steam engine? Who would have thought that shoveling coal into a hungry engine would give a troubled teen the path in life she needed? Definitely not Catra! But here she is! A little heritage railway in the dark woods of SmÃ¥land is her life, her love, her everything!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Until the day she gets a trainee, someone to go along with her to learn the secrets of the steam engine... That would have been well and good hadn't it been for the fact that this... GLIMMER-GIRL... wears a pink ovearall, has pink hair and is... just SO DAMN ANNOYING! So what if Catra is rude to her, it's not like Glimmer likes her anyway!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Or does she?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Be prepared for a bumpy road to love! Get ready for some really greasy, oily and messy romance on the footplate! See the tension rising with the pressure and hear the song of love played out by the whistle of the mighte steam engine!&lt;br /&gt;The Glitra-Heritage railway-AU absolutely NO ONE asked for. But here it is. Enjoy.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;To Lisra, for inspiring me to write a nordic AU.&lt;br /&gt;And to Randomisedmongoose for writing about steam engines before I dared to.&lt;br /&gt;And yes, the title IS from Starlight Express.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>the_Frank</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
